AtteanX::Store::DBI
===================

Created:      2016-03-14
Home page:    <https://metacpan.org/release/AtteanX-Store-DBI/>
Bug tracker:  <https://github.com/kasei/atteanx-store-dbi/issues>

0.004  2026-11-XX

 - (Addition) Add load and dump commands to attean_dbi tool.
 - (Addition) Add support for RDF 1.2 triple terms.
 - (Addition) Add support for init-on-construct.
 - (Update) Fix SQL-generation bug in handling queries where the requested
   graph does not exist in the database.
 - (Update) Fix unicode configuration of the MySQL store.
 - (Update) Fix unicode configuration of the sqlite-based
   temporary_store().
 - (Update) Improve developer tests.
 - (Update) Improvements to path discovery logic in create_schema_file().
 - (Update) Remove dependency on List::MoreUtils.
 - (Update) Skip mysql and postgres tests if the DBD modules or environment
   variables are not available.
 - (Update) Update add_iter to load all quads in a single transaction.
 - (Update) Update dbi_connect_args() to handle both ($type, %args) and
   (%args) calling variants.
 - (Update) Update required version of Attean to 0.041.

0.003  2025-03-11

 - (Update) Fix developer tests to silence warnings.

0.002  2020-12-12

 - (Update) Add DBD::SQLite as a test prereq (#6).
 - (Update) Remove Math::Cartesian::Product from prereq list (#4).
 - (Update) Remove mistakenly added LICENSE file (#5).
 - (Update) Update copyright years (#3).

0.001  2020-12-02

 - (Addition) Initial release.

